jatayu-update-manager (1.2.2~rc1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Expand available-updates table with a compact dashboard layout.
  * Add a one-click focused list mode, preserving update functionality.
  * Show full package versions in table tooltips.
  * Keep English and Hindi translations.
  * Ship a dedicated scalable orange icon for KDE launcher, taskbar and window.
  * Set the matching Qt desktop file identity for Plasma 6.

